MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Esm_m01_001: Our next destination is the forbidden land? Now\nthat sounds like an interesting place!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Esm_m01_003: In fact, I'm thinking a lot about where we've been,\nwhere we're going, even where you're from...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Esm_m01_004: I want to hear about Fódlan. Not all at once, just\nwhatever comes to mind now and then.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Esm_m01_005: I never really thought too much about it, but after\nwhat just happened, I want to know more.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Esm_m01_007: After all, you grew up there, Sweetie. And I guess I\ndescend from someone from Fódlan too.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Esm_m01_008: What's it like there? The people, the cities... I want\nyou to tell me all about it.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c09_Esm_m01: <BLN>We should get a move on!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Fab_m01_001: Our next destination is quite remote. We must\nconsider the time required to traverse that distance.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Fab_m01_005: I suggest we reach the nearby {SetColor=Gold}Fezzan Gate {SetColor=Default}no later\nthan {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Fab_m01_002: If it is as I have read, this investigation should let us\nclose in on the true identity of these celestials.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Fab_m01_004: As regards the desert sun...the mere thought of it has\nme despondent.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c09_Fab_m01: <BLN>Exciting, is it not?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_001: Dietrich, as I hear it, you're a noble back in Fódlan.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_002: That being so, is it fine you've just up and left your\nhouse and are wandering around Dagda?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_003: <NCA>Espouse confidence in Elfrida.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_004: <NCB>Suggest that it does not matter.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_005: <ACA>Ah, your sister is taking care of things. So you just\nstrapped Answerer to your back and off you went.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_006: <ACB>Sorry to pry. Hope you aren't annoyed by\nthe question.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_007: I know I shouldn't stick my nose in your business,\nbut I can't help being curious.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_008: Lately, family's been on my mind.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_009: And I don't think of you as a stranger anymore, so\nyou have too.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01_010: It's not just you. It's also Esme and Fabio.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c09_Mic_m01: <BLN>Something's been on my mind...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Set_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Set_m01_001: The people in your clan seem to be in quite a\nhurry. Going on an expedition somewhere?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Set_m01_002: You must be closely monitored. If you escape my\nattention, there's no telling what you could do.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_Set_m01_003: Go about your business. Then return here. That is\nall for now.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c09_Set_m01: <BLN>In quite a hurry...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B01_m01_001: Word around town is that someone took down Cetus,\nthe Sea Tyrant!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B01_m01_002: Can you believe it? I can't. Who could even DO that?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c09_B01_m01: <BLN>You won't believe this!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B02_m01_001: You're the one who beat up Cetus! It was you, wasn't\nit? You can tell me!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B02_m01_002: I knew it! I knew it had to be you!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c09_B02_m01: <BLN>It has to be you!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B03_m01_001: I've heard about Cetus. As I expected, it was\nyour doing, wasn't it?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B03_m01_002: I am...very relieved to see that you have made it back\nto Dagsion safely.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c09_B03_m01_003: Take this. Please know that I will keep cheering\nfor you.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c09_B03_m01: <BLN>What a relief.